// expect-stderr:   main  panic_in_cleanup.to:10:5
// expect-stderr: suppressed while unwinding: panic[P0001]: bounds: index 3 is out of bounds for an array of length 1: the only valid indices are 0 and -1
// expect-stderr:  --> panic_in_cleanup.to:8:17
